        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCFGR-ONE, Arched Handleset with F Grip</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nGrandeur's Arch Handleset with Reed Grip is a great choice to add classic beauty to your front door. The reed grip design has long been a favorite among designers for its elegance and beauty, as it adds a subtly traditional feel to door hardware of all types. The Arched Handleset with F Grip will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick and have 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It is available in single cylinder and dummy functions. Choose your favorite interior trim knob or lever and finish color to make the Arc One-Piece Reeded Entry Set something that really shows off your personal style.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Arc One-Piece Reeded Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Ideal for doors that are 84 inches or taller.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Arched F Grip Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the lever operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset is does not function--neither locking nor latching.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nInside trim levers are handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to determine left or right handed.</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Arch Handleset with Reed Grip",
                "description": "Grandeur's Arch Handleset with Reed Grip is a great choice to add classic beauty to your front door. The reed grip design has long been a favorite among designers for its elegance and beauty, as it adds a subtly traditional feel to door hardware of all types. The Arched Handleset with F Grip will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick and have 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It is available in single cylinder and dummy functions. Choose your favorite interior trim knob or lever and finish color to make the Arc One-Piece Reeded Entry Set something that really shows off your personal style.",
